  "notes": "Vulnerable _host_is_blocked() tries ipaddress.ip_address() then socket.inet_aton() and returns False (not blocked) when both fail, so every resolvable hostname passes; bypass via any DNS name like 127.0.0.1.nip.io. The fix resolves via socket.getaddrinfo() and blocks on any private answer or gaierror (fails closed). Both states also carry G6: session.get() follows redirects with no per-hop re-validation (GHSA-6h9p-93hq-q7h6, CVE-2026-57115, the SpiderTools redirect-target advisory, is still open against the patched state).",
